-- V7__Seed_expanded_exercise_library.sql
-- Expands the seeded exercise library from 40 to a broad, gym-complete set so
-- that essentially any common movement can be logged without a code change.
--
-- IDs are allocated from 101 upward; the original V3 seed occupies 1..40, so
-- the two blocks can never collide. Category IDs are those seeded in V2 and
-- extended in V6. Audit columns rely on the schema defaults.

